            "subject": "Laptop swap bookings are open",
            "time": "11:15",
            "body": "Laptop swaps for the second floor start next week. Staff can book a slot on the service desk site:\n{{link:book}}\nNobody needs to send us a password: the new laptop signs in with their usual account.\nQuayholt IT",
