                "default": "He points you to the directory and isn't rushing you. Ring him back on the extension the directory lists, then help as usual."
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "hb_call_comms_awkward",
            "kind": "call",
            "callerId": "Niamh Doherty, Internal Communications (calling from a mobile)",
            "from": {
              "name": "Niamh Doherty",
              "address": "Mobile, ending 907"
            },
            "time": "08:41",
            "transcript": [
              {
                "who": "Niamh",
                "text": "It's Niamh in Comms. The town hall stream starts at nine and my account's locked. I genuinely don't have time for this."
              },
              {
                "who": "Niamh",
                "text": "Fine, do it properly. Ring me straight back on the number you hold for me, I'll keep the phone in my hand."
              }
            ],
            "truth": {
              "isPhish": false,
              "flags": [],
              "whyFine": {
                "vish_callback_pressure": "She's stressed and short with you, but she agrees to the callback on the number on file. Impatience isn't a tell; talking you out of the callback is.",
                "default": "A real colleague under pressure. Ringing her back on the number on file takes a minute and settles it. Refusing would leave her stuck, so offer the callback rather than saying no."
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "hb_call_payroll",
            "kind": "call",
